  "descriptions": [
    {
      "source": "DeFiHackLabs",
      "text": "Reentrancy On Sell NFT. Lost: : 137.9 BNB"
    },
    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "StepHeroNFTs on BNB Chain was exploited on February 21, 2025, through a reentrancy vulnerability in referral-reward logic. The attacker drained approximately 137.9 BNB (about $90,000) by repeatedly claiming referral rewards via recursive calls in a single flash-loan-initiated transaction. The StepHeroNFTs contract failed to update referral state before making external value transfers, allowing reentrancy in buyAsset and claimReferral functions. The absence of a reentrancy guard enabled attackers to claim rewards multiple times within the same transaction."
    }
  ],
